{"5074080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parry Dungeon", "steam_appid": 5074080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5074090, 5086080], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry Dungeon</strong> is a first-person game where you traverse dungeons, parry monster attacks, and aim your counterattacks to kill them. Your counterattacks can dismember them, and you can eat their dismembered appendages to heal, or cook them to heal even more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon has unique monsters with their own attacks and behaviors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example: Goblins live in the Goblin Cave, have daggers to cut and stab, will occasionally try to flank or backstab you (while Hobgoblins and Ogres only fight head-on), and sometimes flee when gravely injured or when when you kill superior monsters (Hobgoblins or Ogres) in their vicinity. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/f7a3c7aa7ff76d57ddc425a97165ae52.poster.avif?t=1788310311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/f7a3c7aa7ff76d57ddc425a97165ae52.webm?t=1788310311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/f7a3c7aa7ff76d57ddc425a97165ae52.mp4?t=1788310311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry and Counter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry enemy attacks to turn the tide of battle, stun them, and trigger your counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your counterattack to strike their bodies, dismember their limbs, or decapitate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_para