, and you can eat their dismembered appendages to heal, or cook them to heal even more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon has unique monsters with their own attacks and behaviors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example: Goblins live in the Goblin Cave, have daggers to cut and stab, will occasionally try to flank or backstab you (while Hobgoblins and Ogres only fight head-on), and sometimes flee when gravely injured or when when you kill superior monsters (Hobgoblins or Ogres) in their vicinity. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/f7a3c7aa7ff76d57ddc425a97165ae52.poster.avif?t=1788310311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/f7a3c7aa7ff76d57ddc425a97165ae52.webm?t=1788310311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/f7a3c7aa7ff76d57ddc425a97165ae52.mp4?t=1788310311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry and Counter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry enemy attacks to turn the tide of battle, stun them, and trigger your counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your counterattack to strike their bodies, dismember their limbs, or decapitate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/73d73f71d868d1591c42b99d3a86960d.poster.avif?t=1788310311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5074080/extras/73d73f71d868d1591c42b99d3a86960d.webm?t=1788